dimensional case involving a pointer is somewhat more involved. Here a one-dimensional
array of dimension m*n must be given to the constructor with the contents of the underlying
array being arranged in row major form.
In Listing 7.9 below the contents of a matrix are read from a file and subjected to various
manipulations using tools from the TNT package. The scope resolution operator is employed
to specify references to names in the TNT namespace.
