First observe that the header files for the relevant JAMA package classes have been included:
namely, jama cholesky.h, jama eig.h and jama svd.h for classes Cholesky, Eigenvalue and
SVD, respectively. The solution of our linear system is obtained as a direct application of
the solve function using a Cholesky class object. For the eigenvalue and singular-value
decompositions di ff erent constructors were employed for the TNT Array1D and Array2D
classes that require specification of only the array dimensions. Blank arrays created in this
manner are passed as arguments to the functions that return the eigenvalues, eigenvectors,
singular values and singular vectors.
